### Variables
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/applications
@auth = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth

### Register (first time) – stores the access token for the requests below
POST {{auth}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "me@example.com", "password": "a long password", "displayName": "Me" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Sign in – stores the access token for the requests below
POST {{auth}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "me@example.com", "password": "a long password" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Refresh (uses the refresh_token cookie set by sign-in)
POST {{auth}}/refresh

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Who am I
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create
POST {{base}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Backend Developer",
  "company": "Acme",
  "position": "Mid",
  "status": "APPLIED",
  "appliedDate": "2026-11-20",
  "location": "Sofia",
  "workMode": "HYBRID",
  "salaryMin": 3000,
  "salaryMax": 4500,
  "salaryCurrency": "EUR",
  "jobUrl": "https://acme.example/jobs/1",
  "notes": "Referral from a former colleague"
}

### List (filters + paging + sorting are all optional)
GET {{base}}?status=APPLIED&status=INTERVIEWING&q=backend&page=0&size=20&sort=appliedDate,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one
GET {{base}}/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Full update (status may be omitted to keep the current one)
PUT {{base}}/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior Backend Developer",
  "company": "Acme",
  "appliedDate": "2026-11-20"
}

### Change status only
PATCH {{base}}/{{id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "INTERVIEWING" }

### Dashboard stats
GET {{base}}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
